      "writtenOn": "2022-05-12T10:50:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what you mean by that. The pVM firmware is currently loaded at 0x7fe00000, so that\u0027s where the code and read-only data should be linked for an image to run as pVM firmware. The payload image will start at 0x80200000, after the DTB. (And yes, the writable_data region will currently overlap that if the payload image is bigger than 2 MiB; https://r.android.com/c/2088069 will fix that.)",
      "parentUuid": "7641a36f_bda04c0b",
